bel} has a past-due amount of {due_m} and is {days_late} days late.", "single": "Thank you, your identity is confirmed. I am calling from the collections team about a late payment. {line} Can you make this payment today?", "multi": "Thank you, your identity is confirmed. I am calling from the collections team about late payments on {count} products. {lines} Can you pay all of them today?"}, "facts_var": "item_facts", "summary_var": "summary_line"}')
